  "details": "\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: When cloning a repository with `--local`, Git relies\n     on either making a hardlink or copy to every file in the \"objects\"\n     directory of the source repository. As a result, malformed repository\n     containing symbolic links pointing at the sensitive information on\n     the victim's machine could be copied\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2022-39253.patch: prevent copying symbolic links\n     - debian/patches/tests-for-CVE-2022-39253.patch: tests\n     - CVE-2022-39253",
